<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0b0c">
<meta name="description" content="Born To Banger — interactive digital experiences for events, celebrations and creative moments.">
<title>Born To Banger — Digital Experiences</title>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#09090a; --card:#111113; --text:#f6f4ef; --muted:#9b9b9f;
  --line:rgba(255,255,255,.10); --white:#fff;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);
  font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
.noise{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:.035;z-index:20;background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 180 180' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E")}
.glow{position:absolute;width:600px;height:600px;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(100px);opacity:.18;pointer-events:none}
.g1{background:#7c3aed;top:-320px;left:-220px}.g2{background:#ff4d6d;right:-280px;top:120px}.g3{background:#06b6d4;left:30%;bottom:-450px}
.nav{
  width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto;padding:22px 0;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;position:relative;z-index:3
}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.03em}
.logo{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:11px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff,#777);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#09090a;font-size:14px}
.nav-pill{font-size:13px;color:#b8b8bd;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:9px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.035)}
.hero{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto;min-height:690px;display:flex;align-items:center;position:relative}
.hero-inner{max-width:850px;position:relative;z-index:2;padding:70px 0 90px}
.eyebrow{display:inline-flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#c9c9cc}
.dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#65f5b5;box-shadow:0 0 16px #65f5b5}
h1{font-size:clamp(58px,9vw,118px);line-height:.86;letter-spacing:-.075em;margin:26px 0}
h1 span{display:block;color:#85858a}
.hero p{max-width:620px;color:#a8a8ad;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 30px}
.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{padding:13px 18px;border-radius:13px;border:1px solid var(--line);font-weight:700;font-size:14px;transition:.25s}
.btn.primary{background:#f4f2ec;color:#0a0a0b;border-color:#f4f2ec}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.28)}
.section{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto;padding:70px 0}
.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:30px;margin-bottom:25px}
.kicker{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.15em;font-size:11px;color:#77777c}
h2{font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,58px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:9px 0 0}
.section-head p{color:#7f7f84;max-width:330px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:0}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}
.card{
  min-height:420px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:26px;padding:25px;
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.07),rgba(255,255,255,.025));
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;
  transition:.35s;isolation:isolate
}
.card:before{content:"";position:absolute;width:260px;height:260px;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(50px);opacity:.25;right:-90px;top:-90px;z-index:-1}
.card.ai:before{background:#a855f7}.card.art:before{background:#f59e0b}.card.room:before{background:#06b6d4}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.22)}
.icon{width:54px;height:54px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:24px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.18)}
.num{font-size:11px;color:#6d6d72;letter-spacing:.12em}
.card h3{font-size:29px;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:14px 0 8px}
.card p{color:#8e8e93;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;max-width:290px}
.card-link{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:20px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}
.arrow{width:36px;height:36px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center}
.manifesto{border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:90px 0}
.manifesto p{font-size:clamp(35px,5vw,68px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.06em;max-width:1050px;margin:0}
.manifesto em{font-style:normal;color:#77777c}
.soon{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:14px}
.panel{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:26px;padding:30px;min-height:260px;background:#0e0e10}
.tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:28px}
.tag{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 11px;color:#99999e;font-size:12px}
footer{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto;padding:35px 0 45px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;color:#66666b;font-size:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
@media(max-width:800px){
 .hero{min-height:620px}.grid,.soon{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .card{min-height:340px}.section-head{display:block}.section-head p{margin-top:16px}
 h1{font-size:clamp(54px,16vw,90px)}
}
@media(max-width:520px){
 .nav,.hero,.section,footer{width:min(100% - 28px,1180px)}
 .hero-inner{padding:60px 0}.hero p{font-size:16px}
 .section{padding:52px 0}.manifesto{padding:65px 0}
 footer{flex-direction:column}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="noise"></div>
<div class="glow g1"></div><div class="glow g2"></div><div class="glow g3"></div>

<header class="nav">
  <a class="brand" href="/">
    <span class="logo">BTB</span>
    <span>Born To Banger</span>
  </a>
  <span class="nav-pill">Digital Experiences</span>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Built for moments worth remembering</div>
    <h1>CREATE.<span>PLAY.</span>EXPERIENCE.</h1>
    <p>
      A collection of interactive digital experiences by Born To Banger —
      made for events, celebrations, artists and people who want something different.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn primary" href="#experiences">Explore experiences ↓</a>
      <a class="btn" href="https://www.borntobanger.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit Born To Banger ↗</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="experiences">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div><div class="kicker">01 / Experiences</div><h2>Pick your experience.</h2></div>
    <p>Three live tools. One creative playground. More experiences are on the way.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid">
    <a class="card ai" href="/ai-caricature-studio">
      <div><div class="num">01 — AI</div><div class="icon">✦</div></div>
      <div>
        <h3>AI Caricature Studio</h3>
        <p>Turn a guest photo into a personalised caricature experience in seconds.</p>
        <div class="card-link"><span>Launch Studio</span><span class="arrow">↗</span></div>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="card art" href="/color-my-art">
      <div><div class="num">02 — CREATE</div><div class="icon">✎</div></div>
      <div>
        <h3>Color My Art</h3>
        <p>Choose a design, colour it your way and turn a simple drawing into your artwork.</p>
        <div class="card-link"><span>Start Creating</span><span class="arrow">↗</span></div>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="card room" href="/room">
      <div><div class="num">03 — SOCIAL</div><div class="icon">◉</div></div>
      <div>
        <h3>Room</h3>
        <p>A shared digital space built for watching, listening and experiencing together.</p>
        <div class="card-link"><span>Enter Room</span><span class="arrow">↗</span></div>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="manifesto">
  <div class="section">
    <div class="kicker">02 / The idea</div>
    <p>We don't just organise experiences. <em>We build the digital layer that makes them memorable.</em></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div><div class="kicker">03 / What's next</div><h2>More is coming.</h2></div>
    <p>New interactive tools are being built for the next generation of events.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="soon">
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="num">COMING SOON</div>
      <h3 style="font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:25px 0 0">More ways to make<br>events interactive.</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="num">THE PLAYGROUND</div>
      <div class="tags">
        <span class="tag">AI Experiences</span><span class="tag">Event Games</span>
        <span class="tag">Creative Tools</span><span class="tag">Artist Experiences</span>
        <span class="tag">Interactive Installations</span><span class="tag">Digital Gifting</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>

<footer>
  <span>© 2026 Born To Banger</span>
  <span>Creative experiences for real-world moments.</span>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
